			],
			"Message": "feat(Output): Introduce product identity replacement and standardize whitespace\n\nIntegrate `ReplaceProductIdentity` into the Output build pipeline to strip VS Code's embedded branding (e.g., \"Code - OSS\", \"code-oss\") and replace it with Land's \"FIDDEE\" identity. This plugin reads `Element/Sky/Public/product.json` at build time to dynamically update bundle identifiers, URL protocols, and telemetry names in compiled VS Code artifacts.\n\nUpdate telemetry event metadata in `Source/ESBuild/Output.ts` and `Configuration/ESBuild/Output.js` to use the application key \"fiddee\". Additionally, normalize whitespace in source files by converting literal tab characters to explicit space sequences in CSS polyfills and transform plugins, ensuring consistent formatting and preventing potential regex matching failures in the bundling pipeline.",
			"SHA": "cc19b9e23201759e3e82743b40a0045cff18150d"
